{"seq":2,"slug":"explain-analyze-instrumentation","title":"EXPLAIN ANALYZE 运行时插桩、缓冲区统计与 JIT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/executor-ops/explain-analyze-instrumentation","wordCount":2790,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"explain-analyze-运行时插桩-缓冲区统计与-jit\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE 运行时插桩、缓冲区统计与 JIT</h1><p><code>EXPLAIN</code> 给你的是规划器的<strong>猜测</strong>，<code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 给你的是执行器的<strong>账本</strong>。两者之间隔着一层代码：执行器在每个节点进入和退出时读一次时钟、记一次元组计数，最后聚合成那行 <code>(actual time=0.003..0.003 rows=1.00 loops=10)</code>。这层代码叫插桩（instrumentation），是 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 全部数字的唯一来源。理解它的代价与语义边界，才能判断一行 <code>actual time</code> 到什么程度可信、<code>Buffers: shared read=6</code> 究竟代表几次磁盘 I/O。本篇以 PostgreSQL 18（2025-09-25 发布，<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/release-18.html</code>）为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-插桩把节点进出记成账本\">核心概念：插桩把节点进出记成账本</h2><p>执行器是火山模型：每个计划节点被父节点反复调用 <code>ExecProcNode</code>，每次返回一行。插桩挂在调用链的入口和出口上——进入时记开始时刻，退出时累加耗时与产出行数。查询跑完，每个节点留下一条 <code>(ntuples, nloops, startup_time, total_time, buffer_usage)</code> 记录，渲染器再排版成文本、JSON、YAML 或 XML。</p>\n<p>关键认知：<strong>每个 <code>actual</code> 数字都是聚合后的统计量，不是原始事件</strong>。<code>nloops</code> 记录节点被执行了几次（嵌套循环的内侧节点会有外层行数那么多轮），<code>rows</code> 和 <code>actual time</code> 都是<strong>每轮平均值</strong>。官方原文：「the <code>loops</code> value reports the total number of executions of the node, and the actual time and rows values shown are averages per-execution... Multiply by the <code>loops</code> value to get the total time actually spent in the node」（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/using-explain.html</code>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[ExecProcNode 被父节点调用] --&gt; B[InstrStartNode&lt;br/&gt;读一次时钟]&#10;    B --&gt; C[节点干活&lt;br/&gt;取行/过滤/连接]&#10;    C --&gt; D[产出元组&lt;br/&gt;ntuples += 1]&#10;    D --&gt; E{父节点还要行?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| A&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[InstrStopNode&lt;br/&gt;读一次时钟&lt;br/&gt;累加 total_time]&#10;    F --&gt; G[查询结束聚合所有节点账本]&#10;    G --&gt; H[渲染器输出&lt;br/&gt;actual time / rows / loops]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Buffers 计数&lt;br/&gt;hit/read/dirtied/written]&#10;    H --&gt; J[WAL 计数&lt;br/&gt;records/fpi/bytes]\">flowchart TD\n    A[ExecProcNode 被父节点调用] --&gt; B[InstrStartNode&lt;br/&gt;读一次时钟]\n    B --&gt; C[节点干活&lt;br/&gt;取行/过滤/连接]\n    C --&gt; D[产出元组&lt;br/&gt;ntuples += 1]\n    D --&gt; E{父节点还要行?}\n    E --&gt;|是| A\n    E --&gt;|否| F[InstrStopNode&lt;br/&gt;读一次时钟&lt;br/&gt;累加 total_time]\n    F --&gt; G[查询结束聚合所有节点账本]\n    G --&gt; H[渲染器输出&lt;br/&gt;actual time / rows / loops]\n    H --&gt; I[Buffers 计数&lt;br/&gt;hit/read/dirtied/written]\n    H --&gt; J[WAL 计数&lt;br/&gt;records/fpi/bytes]</pre><p>这层账本有三个可调边界，也是本篇三条主线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插桩开关</th>\n<th>记录的原始量</th>\n<th>关闭后的代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>TIMING</code></td>\n<td>每节点进出时刻</td>\n<td>失去节点级耗时，总运行时间仍测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BUFFERS</code></td>\n<td>每节点缓冲区命中/读/脏/写次数</td>\n<td>无法定位 I/O 出自哪个节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WAL</code></td>\n<td>每节点 WAL 记录数、fpi、字节数</td>\n<td>无法定位写入放大出自哪个节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 真的会执行语句，改数据的语句必须包在事务里回滚，官方模板 <code>BEGIN; EXPLAIN ANALYZE UPDATE ...; ROLLBACK;</code>。这是数据安全的硬要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"timing-的代价-时钟读取如何放大测量误差\">TIMING 的代价：时钟读取如何放大测量误差</h2><p><code>TIMING</code> 默认 <code>TRUE</code>，即 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE)</code> 默认给<strong>每个节点每次执行</strong>读两次系统时钟。官方警告：「The overhead of repeatedly reading the system clock can slow down the query significantly on some systems, so it may be useful to set this parameter to <code>FALSE</code> when only actual row counts, and not exact times, are needed.」（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-explain.html</code>）<code>using-explain</code> 补充了最坏情况：出现在每个节点本身耗时极短、且操作系统取时间调用很慢的机器上。写成可推算的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{measured} \\approx t_{real} + n_{nodes} \\times n_{loops} \\times t_{clock} + t_{compile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{loops}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一项解释了为什么误差<strong>会被循环放大</strong>：一个在嵌套循环内侧、每轮只花 0.1 微秒的索引扫描，若被执行 100 万轮，光时钟开销就足以让 <code>actual time</code> 完全失真。三条实践规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>只要行数、不要时间</strong> → <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, TIMING OFF)</code>。官方明确「Run time of the entire statement is always measured, even when node-level timing is turned off with this option.」，总时间仍会给出，放弃的只是节点级拆分。</li>\n<li><strong>先量时钟开销</strong> → 自带 <code>pg_test_timing</code>，官方就是让你用它测本机时间源开销；返回值偏离 1.0 越远，节点时间越不可信。</li>\n<li><strong>并行计划的 <code>rows</code></strong> → 每个 worker 独立插桩，<code>Gather</code>/<code>Gather Merge</code> 把各 worker 产出汇总，所以并行节点的 <code>rows</code> 是各 worker 之和而非平均值。串行的 <code>loops</code> 与并行的 worker 求和语义不同，混读会得出错误结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>SUMMARY</code> 控制末尾的 <code>Planning Time</code> / <code>Execution Time</code>，在 <code>ANALYZE</code> 下默认开启：<code>Planning Time</code> 不含解析与重写，<code>Execution Time</code> 含执行器启停与触发器但<strong>不含</strong>结果发往客户端的网络时间；要把序列化（含 TOAST 抓取）耗时也算进来，用 <code>SERIALIZE</code> 选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"buffers-与-wal-缓冲区计数的语义陷阱\">BUFFERS 与 WAL：缓冲区计数的语义陷阱</h2><p>PostgreSQL 18 一处对运维影响很大的改动是「Automatically include <code>BUFFERS</code> output in <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>」（release-18）：此前必须手写 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code>，现在默认就在，不想要就显式 <code>BUFFERS OFF</code>。</p>\n<p>最易误读的一点是<strong>它计的是「非去重」的访问次数，不是不同页的数量</strong>。官方原文：这些数字「show the count of the non-distinct buffers hit, read, dirtied, and written for the given node and all of its child nodes」——父节点的计数<strong>包含子节点</strong>，顶层数字不是这一层独有的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见误读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>shared hit</code></td>\n<td>在共享缓冲区里直接找到</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shared read</code></td>\n<td>未命中共享缓冲区，从磁盘<strong>或 OS page cache</strong> 读入</td>\n<td>高估为「真的落盘了」——OS 缓存命中也算入 read</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shared dirtied</code></td>\n<td>本查询弄脏（新页或修改页）</td>\n<td>误以为等于写了多少到磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shared written</code></td>\n<td>本查询把脏页写回磁盘</td>\n<td>与 <code>dirtied</code> 不同：前者「脏了」，后者「刷了」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local</code></td>\n<td>临时表等本地缓冲区</td>\n<td>常被忽略，排查大临时表时是关键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>temp read/written</code></td>\n<td>排序/哈希溢出到临时文件</td>\n<td>只看 <code>shared</code> 会漏掉磁盘溢出的来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>shared read</code> 大于零<strong>不能证明有一次真实磁盘 I/O</strong>——它只说明共享缓冲池没命中，物理读可能被 OS 页缓存吸收。区分这两层要靠实例级 <code>pg_stat_io</code>（18 新增 <code>read_bytes</code>/<code>write_bytes</code>/<code>extend_bytes</code> 三个字节粒度列，取代原来的 <code>op_bytes</code>）配合 <code>track_io_timing</code>。查询级 <code>BUFFERS</code> 答「这条查询碰了哪些页」，实例级 <code>pg_stat_io</code> 答「整个实例的 I/O 长什么样」。</p>\n<p><code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, WAL)</code> 补上写入侧账本，输出 WAL 记录数、全页镜像（fpi）数、生成字节数和 WAL buffer 写满次数（18 新增 full WAL buffer count）。它与 <code>pg_stat_statements</code> 18 新增的 <code>wal_buffers_full</code> 列是同一条链的两端：fpi 计数往往就是「这次 UPDATE 为什么放大」的答案——全页镜像意味着 checkpoint 后第一次修改该页。另有一处坑：<code>BitmapAnd</code> 和 <code>BitmapOr</code> 节点「always report their actual row counts as zero, due to implementation limitations」，<code>rows=0</code> 是插桩实现的限制，不是真的没产出行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jit-编译-编译了什么-何时回不了本\">JIT 编译：编译了什么、何时回不了本</h2><p>PostgreSQL 的 JIT 用 LLVM 把执行期的解释型操作变成原生机器码，默认 provider 是 <code>llvmjit</code>，PostgreSQL 18 要求 LLVM 14 或更高版本（release-18 构建要求条目）。编译对象有三类：<strong>表达式求值</strong>（目标列、<code>WHERE</code> 限定、聚合相关表达式、算子与函数求值）、<strong>元组变形</strong>（tuple deforming，把磁盘元组摊成一个个属性值）、<strong>内联</strong>（把小函数和算子体嵌进编译后的表达式）。另有 <code>jit_expressions</code> 与 <code>jit_tuple_deforming</code> 两个开关，默认都 <code>on</code>（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/jit.html</code>）。</p>\n<p>决定是否编译的是三个代价阈值，它们与规划的<strong>估算代价</strong>比较——是比较估算代价而非实际耗时，所以规划器估错代价时 JIT 开关也会跟着错：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GUC</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>jit</code></td>\n<td><code>on</code></td>\n<td>总开关；配合 <code>jit_above_cost = -1</code> 可彻底关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_above_cost</code></td>\n<td><code>100000</code></td>\n<td>超过此估算代价启用基础 JIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_inline_above_cost</code></td>\n<td><code>500000</code></td>\n<td>超过此值尝试内联；设 <code>-1</code> 禁用内联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jit_optimize_above_cost</code></td>\n<td><code>500000</code></td>\n<td>超过此值运行昂贵的 LLVM 优化；设 <code>-1</code> 禁用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, VERBOSE)</code> 会多出一段 <code>JIT</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"JIT:&#10;  Functions: 346&#10;  Options: Inlining true, Optimization true, Expressions true, Deforming true&#10;  Timing: Generation 22.052 ms, Inlining 42.999 ms, Optimization 126.518 ms, Emission 90.554 ms, Total 282.123 ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>JIT:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Functions: 346</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Options: Inlining true, Optimization true, Expressions true, Deforming true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Timing: Generation 22.052 ms, Inlining 42.999 ms, Optimization 126.518 ms, Emission 90.554 ms, Total 282.123 ms</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Functions</code> 是生成的函数个数，<code>Options</code> 给出哪几级被启用，<code>Timing</code> 把编译开销拆成生成 IR、内联、优化、发射机器码四段。<strong>这一段是判断 JIT 是否帮倒忙的唯一直接证据</strong>：把 <code>Total</code> 与 <code>Execution Time</code> 并看，如果编译占了执行时间的一大块、而该查询模板一天只跑几次，成本根本没机会摊销。摊销条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times \\Delta t_{speedup} &gt; T_{compile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是同一编译产物被复用的执行次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{speedup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每次执行节省的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{compile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是 <code>Timing: Total</code>。短 OLTP 查询里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 小、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{speedup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也小，左边几乎必然小于右边——这就是为什么大量实践在 OLTP 负载上直接 <code>SET jit = off</code>，或把 <code>jit_above_cost</code> 调得远高于默认的 100000。官方对 JIT 的定位也是「CPU-intensive query work」，收益显著的场景是长跑、CPU 密集、表达式与函数调用密集的分析查询。反过来说，若 <code>Functions</code> 只有个位数而 <code>Total</code> 却有几十毫秒，那就是编译在小查询上白烧钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-auto_explain-做采样插桩\">用 auto_explain 做采样插桩</h2><p>手工 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 只覆盖你主动去跑的语句，生产环境里慢的是那些没空去跑的长尾查询。<code>auto_explain</code> 把插桩接到日志上：它必须在会话里 <code>LOAD &#39;auto_explain&#39;</code>，或通过 <code>session_preload_libraries</code> 预加载（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/auto-explain.html</code>）。默认行为是<strong>什么都不做</strong>——<code>log_min_duration</code> 默认 <code>-1</code>，必须显式设成 0（全记）或一个毫秒阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>log_min_duration</code></td>\n<td><code>-1</code></td>\n<td>超过此时长的语句才记录计划；<code>0</code> = 全记；<code>-1</code> = 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_analyze</code></td>\n<td><code>off</code></td>\n<td>打开才输出 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 式统计，否则只有估算计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_buffers</code></td>\n<td><code>off</code></td>\n<td>等价 <code>BUFFERS</code>，仅在 <code>log_analyze</code> 开启时有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_timing</code></td>\n<td><code>on</code></td>\n<td>等价 <code>TIMING</code>；关掉可显著降低插桩开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_wal</code></td>\n<td><code>off</code></td>\n<td>等价 <code>WAL</code>，仅 <code>log_analyze</code> 开启时有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_format</code></td>\n<td><code>text</code></td>\n<td>可取 <code>text</code>/<code>xml</code>/<code>json</code>/<code>yaml</code>，进分析流水线时选 json</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_level</code></td>\n<td><code>LOG</code></td>\n<td>日志级别，可降级到 <code>DEBUG1</code> 等避免污染主日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sample_rate</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>只解释每个会话中的一部分语句，<code>1</code> = 全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>log_parameter_max_length</code></td>\n<td><code>-1</code></td>\n<td>参数值记录长度，<code>-1</code> 全记，<code>0</code> 不记（防敏感值入日志）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条性能警告必须照着执行：官方对 <code>log_analyze</code> 的原话是「When this parameter is on, per-plan-node timing occurs for all statements executed, whether or not they run long enough to actually get logged. This can have an extremely negative impact on performance.」——<strong>开 <code>log_analyze</code> 后所有语句都会逐节点计时，哪怕它根本不够长、不会被记录</strong>。缓解是同时设 <code>log_timing = off</code>：保留行数和缓冲区计数（往往已够定位问题），丢掉节点级耗时，换回大部分性能。这与前面 <code>TIMING OFF</code> 是同一条道理的两种落法。</p>\n<p>生产上更稳的组合是分层：先用较高的 <code>log_min_duration</code> 加 <code>log_analyze = off</code> 收「谁进了计划执行」的粗账；需要深挖时再对特定会话开 <code>log_analyze = on, log_timing = off, log_buffers = on</code>，或在高流量实例上用低 <code>sample_rate</code>（如 <code>0.01</code>）只采样 1%——注意嵌套语句的采样是「全有或全无」，不会把一个函数调用链拆散。<code>auto_explain</code> 的参数只能由超级用户修改，这也是它适合做运维工具而不适合给业务会话随意开关的原因。</p>\n<p>把插桩数据与统计信息串起来才能形成闭环：<code>Buffers</code> 告诉你哪一步真的碰了数据，<code>JIT</code> 告诉你编译有没有回本，而估算与实测的行数差则指向统计信息本身。行数估算偏差的系统性成因见 <code>./../2_statistics-cost-model/3_extended-stats-estimation-bias.md</code>；计划形状为何被搜索算法选中是 <code>./../3_plan-search-join/1_path-enumeration-dp.md</code> 的主题；把 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 的数字翻译回选择率与代价公式参照 <code>./../2_statistics-cost-model/2_selectivity-cost-model.md</code>；当查询反复被解析却命中缓存时，<code>Planning Time</code> 的异常会先在 <code>./../1_parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/3_planner-entry-plan-cache.md</code> 描述的缓存路径上显现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>插桩是 <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 全部数字的唯一来源，记录的是<strong>聚合统计量</strong>：<code>rows</code>/<code>actual time</code> 是每轮平均值，总时间需乘 <code>loops</code>。</li>\n<li><code>TIMING</code> 默认开，每节点每次执行读两次时钟，误差随 <code>nloops</code> 放大；只要行数时用 <code>TIMING OFF</code>，总运行时间仍会给出；用 <code>pg_test_timing</code> 量本机时钟开销。</li>\n<li><code>BUFFERS</code> 在 PostgreSQL 18 起默认随 <code>ANALYZE</code> 输出；计数是<strong>非去重</strong>的访问次数，父节点包含子节点；<code>shared read</code> 可能命中的是 OS page cache，不等于真实磁盘 I/O，需 <code>pg_stat_io</code> 配合。</li>\n<li><code>WAL</code> 给出记录数、fpi、字节数与 WAL buffer 写满次数；<code>SERIALIZE</code> 把输出转换（含 TOAST 抓取）耗时单独列出并计入 <code>Execution Time</code>。</li>\n<li>JIT 由三个代价阈值驱动（<code>100000</code> / <code>500000</code> / <code>500000</code>），比较的是<strong>估算代价</strong>；<code>JIT</code> 段的 <code>Timing: Total</code> 是判断编译是否回本的直接证据，摊销条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times \\Delta t_{speedup} &gt; T_{compile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><code>auto_explain</code> 默认完全关闭；<code>log_analyze = on</code> 会让<strong>所有</strong>语句逐节点计时，必须用 <code>log_timing = off</code> 或低 <code>sample_rate</code> 控制成本。</li>\n<li>三个开关对应三条独立证据线：<code>TIMING</code> 给时间、<code>BUFFERS</code>/<code>WAL</code> 给 I/O、<code>JIT</code> 给编译成本。忽略语义边界，就会把工具的输出读成另一个意思。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EXPLAIN ANALYZE 运行时插桩、缓冲区统计与 JIT","id":"explain-analyze-运行时插桩-缓冲区统计与-jit"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：插桩把节点进出记成账本","id":"核心概念-插桩把节点进出记成账本"},{"level":2,"text":"TIMING 的代价：时钟读取如何放大测量误差","id":"timing-的代价-时钟读取如何放大测量误差"},{"level":2,"text":"BUFFERS 与 WAL：缓冲区计数的语义陷阱","id":"buffers-与-wal-缓冲区计数的语义陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"JIT 编译：编译了什么、何时回不了本","id":"jit-编译-编译了什么-何时回不了本"},{"level":2,"text":"用 auto_explain 做采样插桩","id":"用-auto_explain-做采样插桩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执行器节点树与火山迭代执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/executor-ops/executor-node-tree"},"next":{"title":"计划回归排查、auto_explain 与调优运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/executor-ops/plan-regression-tuning"}}